On Sun, Apr 9, 2023 at 4:53=E2=80=AFPM Colin McCabe <cmccabe@apache.org> wr=
ote:

> >
> > Until this is the case and unless we carry out a Zookeeper version
> upgrade we leave users to run on an end-of-life version with unpatched CV=
Es
