--------------------------------------

             Summary: Producer write while transaction is pending.
                 Key: KAFKA-14917
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14917
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Justine Olshan
