> h1. State stores lose state when tasks are reassigned under EOS with stan=
dby replicas and default acceptable lag.
> I have observed that state stores used in a transform step under a Exactl=
y Once semantics ends up losing state after a rebalancing event that includ=
es reassignment of tasks to previous standby task within the acceptable sta=
ndby lag.
> =C2=A0
> The problem is reproduceable and an integration test have been created to=
 showcase the [issue|https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/12540].=C2=A0
