---------------------------------

             Summary: Refactoring for client code to reduce boilerplate
                 Key: KAFKA-14937
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14937
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
          Components: admin, clients, consumer, producer 
