> >> >> APIs, this one is intended for use by administrators only. Most use=
rs
> >> >> indeed should not need to know what a controller is or interact wit=
h
> it
> >> >> directly. If they do interact it should be very clear that they are
> >> doing
> >> >> so. The --controller-bootstrap flag makes it very clear, as does th=
e
> >> >> separate configuration.
> >> >>
> >> >> Let me give an example of the kind of problems that arise if you
