> >> >      - userB
> >> >
> >> > This would allow us to define non-committers as collaborators on the
> >> Github
> >> > project. Concretely, this means they would receive the "triage" Gith=
ub
> >> role
> >> > (defined here
> >> >
> >>
> https://docs.github.com/en/organizations/managing-user-access-to-your-org=
anizations-repositories/repository-roles-for-an-organization#permissions-fo=
r-each-role
> >> ).
> >> > Practically, this means we could let non-committers do things like
> assign
